  "type": "manhwa",
  "description": "Yeon Bo-Ra is the CEO of Wedding Violet, Korea's top wedding shop. Although she's respected at work, it's the opposite at home, where she's mistreated by her grandmother and cousin, Ji-Yeong, due to her parents' past. Ji-Yeong even uses this dark secret to threaten Bo-Ra and her business. One day, out of anger, Bo-Ra proposes to top star An Do-Un, knowing Ji-Yeong has her eye on him. But not only does he accept, he actually shows extreme interest! Who knew that he would say yes to a total stranger?! \n\n(Source: Tapas, edited)",
